# Building and Uploading sparkcan to PPA

1. Update `debian/changelog` top entry with the target series and version.

2. Generate the orig tarball (once per upstream version):
```bash
tar --exclude=./debian -czf ../sparkcan_1.2.1.orig.tar.gz -C .. sparkcan
```

3. Build signed source package:
   - First upload for a new upstream version (include orig tarball):
```bash
debuild -S -sa
```
   - Rebuilding for another series, same upstream version (orig already in PPA):
```bash
debuild -S -sd
```

4. Upload:
```bash
dput ppa:graysonarendt/sparkcan ../sparkcan_1.2.1-1~SERIES1_source.changes
```
